#!genome-build GRCh37.p13
# Synthetic Ensembl GRCh37-style GTF (accessions and coordinates are made up). GRCh37 Ensembl GTFs repeat
# a pseudoautosomal gene on Y with the same gene/transcript IDs as on X, so the transcript keeps the X
# coordinates and records Y in other_chroms.
